    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>If only</strong>&quot;</i> is a horror, puzzle-solving, and story-exploration game from Vietnam. You will play as a high school student seeking answers to the questions that have always haunted his mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did his mother die?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does he often experience strange occurrences?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did his father neglect the family?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Solving: Search for clues, collect items, and solve puzzles to unlock the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Investigate every corner of the house, where many secrets are hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction: Your decisions can lead to different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline: Uncover the hidden tragedies of the protagonist\u2019s family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie Atmosphere: The game contains some scary visuals, tense sounds, and unexpected situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Vietnamese Culture: From the setting to household items, everything reflects the unique characteristics of Vietnam. Through this game, you will gain more insight into Vietnamese culture.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;<strong>If only</strong>&quot;</i> is a horror, puzzle-solving, and story-exploration game from Vietnam. You will play as a high school student seeking answers to the questions that have always haunted his mind:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did his mother die?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does he often experience strange occurrences?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did his father neglect the family?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Solving: Search for clues, collect items, and solve puzzles to unlock the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Investigate every corner of the house, where many secrets are hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction: Your decisions can lead to different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline: Uncover the hidden tragedies of the protagonist\u2019s family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie Atmosphere: The game contains some scary visuals, tense sounds, and unexpected situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Vietnamese Culture: From the setting to household items, everything reflects the unique characteristics of Vietnam. Through this game, you will gain more insight into Vietnamese culture.</p></li></ul>",
